{
  "course": "初中60短文",
  "passage": 23,
  "title": "Passage 23",
  "voice": "温暖自然英式女老师｜IndexTTS2.5 慢速教学",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 1,
      "sourceSentenceId": 1,
      "chunkId": "s23-p01",
      "image": "assets/images/01.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p01.mp3",
      "en": "About 80% of people do not get enough Vitamin D every day.",
      "cn": "大约80%的人每天都无法摄入足够的维生素D。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 2,
      "sourceSentenceId": 2,
      "chunkId": "s23-p02",
      "image": "assets/images/02.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p02.mp3",
      "en": "But this vitamin is very important for your health.",
      "cn": "但这种维生素对你的健康非常重要。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 3,
      "sourceSentenceId": 3,
      "chunkId": "s23-p03",
      "image": "assets/images/03.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p03.mp3",
      "en": "Vitamin D is really important for our bones.",
      "cn": "维生素D对我们的骨骼至关重要。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 4,
      "sourceSentenceId": 4,
      "chunkId": "s23-p04",
      "image": "assets/images/04.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p04.mp3",
      "en": "When we are young, vitamin D builds up our bones and makes them strong.",
      "cn": "当我们年轻时，维生素D可以促进骨骼发育，使其强健。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 5,
      "sourceSentenceId": 5,
      "chunkId": "s23-p05",
      "image": "assets/images/05.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p05.mp3",
      "en": "When we are older, we still need vitamin D to keep our bones strong.",
      "cn": "当我们年老时，仍需要维生素D来维持骨骼强健。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 6,
      "sourceSentenceId": 6,
      "chunkId": "s23-p06",
      "image": "assets/images/06.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p06.mp3",
      "en": "Our bodies keep the vitamin D in our bones and teeth.",
      "cn": "我们的身体会将维生素D储存在骨骼和牙齿中。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 7,
      "sourceSentenceId": 7,
      "chunkId": "s23-p07",
      "image": "assets/images/07.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p07.mp3",
      "en": "Then we lose vitamin D as we work and exercise during the day.",
      "cn": "随着我们一天的工作和运动，维生素D会损耗。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 8,
      "sourceSentenceId": 8,
      "chunkId": "s23-p08",
      "image": "assets/images/08.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p08.mp3",
      "en": "But our bodies can't make vitamin D.",
      "cn": "而我们的身体无法自行合成维生素D。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 9,
      "sourceSentenceId": 9,
      "chunkId": "s23-p09",
      "image": "assets/images/09.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p09.mp3",
      "en": "So we have to get it from outside of our bodies.",
      "cn": "所以我们必须从身体外部获取它。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 10,
      "sourceSentenceId": 10,
      "chunkId": "s23-p10",
      "image": "assets/images/10.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p10.mp3",
      "en": "Where can we get this very important vitamin?",
      "cn": "那我们从哪里可以获取这种非常重要的维生素呢？"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 11,
      "sourceSentenceId": 11,
      "chunkId": "s23-p11",
      "image": "assets/images/11.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p11.mp3",
      "en": "Vitamin D is in foods like fish, eggs, cabbages and meat such as beef and pork.",
      "cn": "维生素D存在于鱼类、蛋类、卷心菜和像牛肉、猪肉等肉类食物中。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 12,
      "sourceSentenceId": 12,
      "chunkId": "s23-p12",
      "image": "assets/images/12.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p12.mp3",
      "en": "Sometimes, vitamin D is added to bread and orange juice.",
      "cn": "有时，面包和橙汁中会添加维生素D。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 13,
      "sourceSentenceId": 13,
      "chunkId": "s23-p13",
      "image": "assets/images/13.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p13.mp3",
      "en": "Dairy products like milk, butter and yogurt provide vitamin D as well.",
      "cn": "牛奶、黄油和酸奶等乳制品也能提供维生素D。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 14,
      "sourceSentenceId": 14,
      "chunkId": "s23-p14",
      "image": "assets/images/14.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p14.mp3",
      "en": "We should be sure to eat such foods that are rich in vitamin D when choosing from a menu.",
      "cn": "我们从菜单中选择菜品时，应确保食用这些富含维生素D的食物。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 15,
      "sourceSentenceId": 15,
      "chunkId": "s23-p15",
      "image": "assets/images/15.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p15.mp3",
      "en": "Food is not the only way our bodies can get vitamin D.",
      "cn": "食物并不是我们身体获取维生素D的唯一途径。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 16,
      "sourceSentenceId": 16,
      "chunkId": "s23-p16",
      "image": "assets/images/16.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p16.mp3",
      "en": "The sun also gives us vitamin D.",
      "cn": "太阳也能为我们提供维生素D。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 17,
      "sourceSentenceId": 17,
      "chunkId": "s23-p17",
      "image": "assets/images/17.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p17.mp3",
      "en": "Too much sun is not good for you.",
      "cn": "过多晒太阳不好。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 18,
      "sourceSentenceId": 18,
      "chunkId": "s23-p18",
      "image": "assets/images/18.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p18.mp3",
      "en": "But about 15 minutes a day is usually enough.",
      "cn": "但每天晒大约15分钟通常就够了。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 19,
      "sourceSentenceId": 19,
      "chunkId": "s23-p19",
      "image": "assets/images/19.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p19.mp3",
      "en": "Living in a flat might limit your sun exposure.",
      "cn": "待在公寓里可能会限制你晒太阳。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 20,
      "sourceSentenceId": 20,
      "chunkId": "s23-p20",
      "image": "assets/images/20.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p20.mp3",
      "en": "So consider using your passport to visit sunny places.",
      "cn": "所以不妨考虑一下，拿上你的护照，前往阳光充足的地方。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 21,
      "sourceSentenceId": 21,
      "chunkId": "s23-p21",
      "image": "assets/images/21.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p21.mp3",
      "en": "Some people may need to take vitamin D pills.",
      "cn": "有些人可能需要服用维生素D药片。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 22,
      "sourceSentenceId": 22,
      "chunkId": "s23-p22",
      "image": "assets/images/22.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p22.mp3",
      "en": "You can conveniently get them at a local mall.",
      "cn": "你可以方便地在当地商场买到它们。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 23,
      "sourceSentenceId": 23,
      "chunkId": "s23-p23",
      "image": "assets/images/23.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p23.mp3",
      "en": "But it is important to consult a doctor if you think you aren't getting enough vitamin D.",
      "cn": "但如果你认为自己没有摄入足够的维生素D，咨询医生很重要。"
    }
  ],
